### CLASS AXIOMS & RESTRICTIONS

:BuyerRole owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :playedBy ; owl:someValuesFrom :Organization ] .

:Pivot_OrganizationRoleAssignment owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :assignedRole ; owl:someValuesFrom :AgentRole ] ,
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :assignedOrganization ; owl:someValuesFrom :Organization ] ,
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :inMessage ; owl:someValuesFrom :InvoiceMessage ] .

:InvoiceMessage owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasHeader ; owl:someValuesFrom :MessageHeader ] ,
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasDetail ; owl:someValuesFrom :MessageDetail ] ,
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasSummary ; owl:someValuesFrom :MessageSummary ] .

:Item owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasLineSegment ; owl:someValuesFrom :LINSegment ] ,
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasPIASegment ; owl:someValuesFrom :PIASegment ] ,
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasQTYSegment ; owl:someValuesFrom :QTYSegment ] .

### DISJOINTNESS

:MessageHeader owl:disjointWith :MessageDetail , :MessageSummary .
:MessageDetail owl:disjointWith :MessageSummary .
:BuyerRole owl:disjointWith :DeliveryPartyRole .
:BGMSegment owl:disjointWith :NADSegment , :DTMSegment , :MOASegment , :QTYSegment , :LINSegment , :PIASegment , :TAXSegment , :ALCSegment , :UNSSegment .

